      "rva_or_symbol": "sub_101D3890 inline __asm cpuid",
      "description": "Reads real 'GenuineIntel'/'AuthenticAMD' + EAX=1 signature, formats '%s-%08x'. NOT patched. Bypassed via HwidBuilder JMP. Patcher hardcodes replacement 'GenuineIntel-000906EA' (Skylake i7-6700K signature) in the code-cave HWID string — every patched client transmits the SAME cpu= value, creating a strong server-side fingerprint of patched clients.",
